{"v":4,"catch":"大爆炸即將發生！","desc":"《VS.STAR LUSTER》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1985年發行的射擊遊戲。\n玩家利用星光「G.A.I.A」對抗試圖製造大爆炸的入侵者「Battura」。\n透過在地圖模式（您可以選擇要攻擊的敵人）和戰鬥空間中的戰鬥模式之間切換，保衛您的基地免受敵人的侵害。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-06-13","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9d22be9e2a9aa6b98307d9fdd3445be3eb27e2e5f561e1128c49d65ce9e46b44.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c928bfaed4a4ac1b0eb81f95cb113fe9402454974642a3eeb675dd4c7abb0f98.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/658d6d7c02528b3ef5dcf927eda1aee050ee91601403cee32da591338fbc916e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/77f014930f1b99a3943a69978c3ebdc0fbe6fe1212e11335717272aedc16fdac.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e6794e5f06afd4065202acd8e182c49e05b3fe41ecada08f2db4b9729d04f6fa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ea4f61e72b54767a621627ef39dc89e0b12b4cf09402b2ec9bb0588ca7c61ccf.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c6401ed0a000","dlc":[]}